# PHP Backend Code
#
# This directory contains server-side PHP code that runs in PHP-FPM.
#
# Example structure:
#   src/php/
#   ├── Http/
#   │   ├── Controller/
#   │   └── Middleware/
#   ├── Domain/
#   └── Infrastructure/
#
# Namespace: App\
# Autoloading: PSR-4 via composer.json
#
# If you're not using PHP, delete this directory and remove
# PHP service from compose.yaml.
